 him, would you call him mostly peaceful, or would you call him extremely abusive and likely to kill you one of these days?\n\n\nOr how about if someone only raped 10% of the time, would you not call him a rapist?\n\n\nHow about in 10% of the discussions you had with him he would get physical with you: punching you in the face, etc, start breaking things and burning things in your home. Would you not call him violent and volatile?\n\n\nBonus!: If you organized your society so 10% of the males were terrorists, would you not call that \u201csociety\u201d terroristic?", "author": "GodIsPerfect", "created": 1790617195523, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "GodIsPerfect", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\u201cThe \u2018Protests\u2019 were 90% peaceful and therefore mostly peaceful\u201d. Well, No. That\u2019s retarded. Here\u2019re three ways to respond to that if you want to bring that up again to someone who still thinks that.", "last_comment_created": 1790621335324, "content": "<p>If your husband only beat you 10% of the time you knew him, would you call him mostly peaceful, or would you call him extremely abusive and likely to kill you one of these days?</p>\n<p>Or how about if someone only raped 10% of the time, would you not call him a rapist?</p>\n<p>How about in 10% of the discussions you had with him he would get physical with you: punching you in the face, etc, start breaking things and burning things in your home. Would you not call him violent and volatile?</p>\n<p>Bonus!: If you organized your society so 10% of the males were terrorists, would you not call that \u201csociety\u201d terroristic?</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_sti